    "body": "Closes #256\n\n**Classification:** T1 (auto-fixable)\n**Labels:** bug-fixer\n\n### Summary of Changes\n- **Search scope refinement**: Explicitly excluded `test/`, `tests/`, `tmp/`, `managed_components/`, `stubs/`, `portal_assets/`, `third_party/`, `vendor/`, `node_modules/`, `.pio/`, and `.agents/` from `check_missing_nothrow()`, `check_std_function_member()`, `check_tick_heap_allocation()`, and `check_eventbus_thread_safety()`.\n- **String literal & comment filtering**: In `check_missing_nothrow()`, stripped string literals (`\"...\"`) and trailing inline comments (`//.*`), and dropped doc comments / block comment lines (`*`, `/*`, `*/`). This prevents string literals containing \"new\" (such as `ESP_LOGD(\"CRYPTO\", \"Generated and firmly committed new MAC-derived...\")`) and doc comments (such as `* ... new HTTP request`) from triggering false positives.\n- **Strict allocation matching**: Used `\\bnew[[:space:]]+[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_:<>]*[[:space:]]*[({[;]` to accurately identify constructor calls, aggregate initializations, array allocations, or default-initializations while skipping prose.\n- **Detailed reporting**: Changed reported finding locations to `file:line` format (e.g. `modules/BLEManager/BLEStack.cpp:365`) so auditors can immediately pinpoint and verify exact allocation sites.\n- **Expanded `check_std_function_member`**: Now audits both `*.hpp` and `*.h` files and matches `using X = std::function<...>` type aliases and direct member variables.\n- **Audit guide clarification**: Added a note to `guides/release-audit.md` (Dimension 5) explaining that `OTAUpdateManager` legitimately calls `setInsecure()` because firmware binaries and manifests are independently signed with RSA-2048 (`MbedTLSSignatureVerifier`), and clarifying that OTA downloads do not route through `KeyManager`.\n\n### Verification\n1. **Audit Script Check:**\nRan `bash .agents/skills/framework-expert/scripts/release-audit-checks.sh .`:\n- `missing_nothrow` correctly identifies the exact 7 real bare `new` sites across 3 files on baseline (`modules/BLEManager/BLEStack.cpp:365`, `modules/BLEManager/BLEStack.cpp:608`, `modules/ButtonModule/ButtonModule.cpp:163`, `modules/ButtonModule/ButtonModule.cpp:219`, `modules/ButtonModule/ButtonModule.cpp:272`, `modules/DataManager/DataManager.cpp:181`, `modules/DataManager/DataManager.cpp:183`), reducing false positives from 106 files to 0.\n- `std_function_member` correctly reports all 5 stored member/alias sites with line numbers across `*.hpp` and `*.h`.\n\n2. **Native Test Suite:**\nRan `pio test -e native`:\n```\n949 test cases: 949 succeeded in 00:00:52.929\n```\n\n3. **Leak Scan:**\nRan `python3 .agents/plugins/bug-fixer-loop-plugin/scripts/pre_tool_gate.py --scan-only .`:\n`LEAK SCAN CLEAN`\n\n**Design review:** Checked spec for release audit checks and memory safety rules. No conflicting decisions found.",
